``` LSASS memory access by an unusual process
    MITRE ATT&CK: T1003.001 OS Credential Dumping: LSASS Memory
    Logic: Sysmon Event ID 10 process access to lsass.exe from a process outside the allowlist.
    Known false positives: EDR, AV and backup agents.
    Tuning: build the allowlist from your baseline and match on full path. ```
index=sysmon EventCode=10 TargetImage="*\\lsass.exe"
| search NOT SourceImage IN ("*\\MsMpEng.exe", "*\\csrss.exe", "*\\wininit.exe", "*\\svchost.exe", "*\\WerFault.exe")
| stats count min(_time) as first_seen values(GrantedAccess) as access by host SourceImage SourceUser
| convert ctime(first_seen)
| sort - count
